 "note": "41 lamps. Light_<name> under its parent node at positionLocal, looking along forward with up (LookRotation). intensity: URP units at 100 % (E = I / d^2), peakCandela: the IES peak. Spot lights carry the cookie made from the same emission diagram as IES/<ies> (the shape of the IES profile inside the cone); point lights no cookie. toggle / fuse: the switch and fuse of the circuit (empty: turn -> the flasher, reverse -> gear R, hand -> the WorkLamp item on Plug_12V, torch -> Flashlight, flare -> Flare_N, fire -> the stove). ownPower: not on the van bus. lens: the renderer that glows with the lamp. dimmedBy: the snow part over the lamp (light x (1 - 0.85 x snow)). watts: draw at 12 V (load on the battery). Tail lamps double as brake lamps (x4).",
